led, their foot treads upon something soft."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Persica?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ow-ow-ow... Argh, that hurt...!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why are you sleeping on the floor?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander jumps aside immediately and watches as the figure flings a blanket off herself. Its original color is no longer discernible."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't want a newspaper subscription, I don't need a water purifier, and I don't take new commissions, goodbye."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_XXS_kick","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","value":"%%type_id=2%%duration=1%%delay=0.1%%range=5","raw":"controll_shake"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thud. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"With that, she collapses again."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"LWMMGMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"LWMMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please stop sleep-talking, Miss Persica! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Wake up! We need your help!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ugh... Hm... Uh. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Stop... bothering me."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Despite being held up by the collar and shaken roughly by LWMMG, Persica's body is completely slack. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Glaring at the Commander with eyes still half asleep, she mutters weakly..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you... want... to die?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please don't make such scary threats in that tone! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry... You're usually still up working at this hour, so I thought..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That makes... my sleeping time... especially precious..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please help me build a machine that can mass-produce chocolate."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Close the door behind yourselves."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Persica jerks LWMMG's hand away and lies back down."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","value":"%%type_id=2%%duration=2%%delay=0.1%%range=5","raw":"controll_shake"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait! You're my only hope, Persica!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","value":"%%type_id=2%%duration=2%%delay=0.1%%range=5","raw":"controll_shake"}],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Give me back... my blanket!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"m_wv_scenario","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops"